			<tr><td><a href="img/sango002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/sango002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/sango/img/sango002.jpg" --></a><a href="img/sango003.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/sango003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/sango/img/sango003.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
